Review this JSON payload and identify ALL validation errors. Return a JSON array of error descriptions (strings).

{"user": {"name": "John", "email": "john(at)example.com", "age": 175, "phone": "12345", "signup_date": "2026-13-45"}, "order": {"amount": -50.00, "currency": "USD", "items": []}}

Look for: invalid email format, impossible age, invalid phone length, invalid date, negative amount, and empty required array. Output ONLY the JSON array.
